=== F4: fixture columns generated from the classifier ===
A TypeScript fixer loaded every mockup card, rebuilt a synthetic TrackInput
from the captured fields, called classifyTrack, and wrote column, state, and
reason from the result. Exactly seven cards changed: inv_13, inv_68, inv_307,
inv_318, inv_7, inv_8, and inv_11 moved from column in-progress to column
blocked while keeping state waits-pm. All other fixture fields, all 739 Done
cards, and all eight gate groups are unchanged. No open fixture card has an
empty reason.

=== New regression test ===
src/green-r2.test.ts now loads mockup/fixtures.json and asserts, for every
card, that the column matches the column the real classifier gives for its
state, and that the reason is non-empty. A control run on the 643912a fixture
fails with exactly the seven named cards. The fixed fixture passes.

=== Preview check ===
preview/preview.ts passes fixture cards straight into the board. A render
probe over all eight repos succeeded. The card inv_13 now appears inside
data-column="blocked", which is the Waits for PM column, and its reason is
visible.

